# Week 7 Fleet Analytics Dashboard

## Tableau Public Dashboard

The interactive Aido Rover Fleet Analytics Dashboard is published on Tableau Public:

https://public.tableau.com/shared/2RPD4D3YG?:display_count=n&:origin=viz_share_link

## Dashboard Panels

The dashboard contains four analytical panels:

1. Fleet Overview
2. Time-Series Monitor
3. Classification Insights
4. Anomaly Alert Summary

The dashboard integrates analytical results from Weeks 2–6, including exploratory data analysis, time-series forecasting, Random Forest classification, feature importance analysis, and anomaly detection.

## Tableau Workbook

The Tableau workbook used to create the dashboard is included in this folder as `Aido Rover Fleet Analytics Dashboard.twb`.
